   "title": "Parliament’s Human Rights Committee calls for reintroduction of safe disciplinary measures in SHSs",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/parliaments-human-rights-committee-calls-for-reintroduction-of-safe-disciplinary-measures-in-shss/",
