   "title": "‘Bada pataka’ under the counter, fake green labels on display: Banned firecrackers flood Delhi markets after Supreme Court nod",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Delhi/bada-pataka-under-the-counter-fake-green-labels-on-display-banned-firecrackers-flood-delhi-markets-after-supreme-court-nod/article71657021.ece",
