   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription Hours after the Supreme Court permitted the bursting of certified green firecrackers in Delhi-NCR on November 7 and 8, traditional firecrackers were being openly sold, albeit discreetly, in Old Delhi’s Sadar Bazar and Jama Masjid markets. A visit by The Hindu found vendors concealing banned crackers in cartons and black polythene bags beneath displays of green-labelled fireworks, with some selling conventional crackers without the QR codes required to verify their authenticity.",
   "summary_zh": "最高法院允许在德里—国家首都区于11月7日和8日燃放经认证的绿色烟花后，人们仍通过订阅时段解锁相关内容；传统烟花也在老德里的萨达尔巴扎和贾玛清真寺市场公开兜售，尽管商家较为隐蔽。《印度教徒报》实地探访发现，摊主把违禁烟花藏在纸箱和黑色塑料袋里，藏在绿色标签烟花展示架下；一些商家还出售没有用于核验真伪的二维码的普通烟花。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription Hours after the Supreme Court permitted the bursting of certified green firecrackers in Delhi-NCR on November 7 and 8, traditional firecrackers were being openly sold, albeit discreetly, in Old Delhi’s Sadar Bazar and Jama Masjid markets. A visit by The Hindu found vendors concealing banned crackers in cartons and black polythene bags beneath displays of green-labelled fireworks, with some selling conventional crackers without the QR codes required to verify their authenticity. At least 10 vendors approached by The Hindu said traditional firecrackers, referred to in the market as “bada pataka”, were available. One vendor opened his phone to show photographs of rockets, bombs, flowerpots and ground spinners, along with their prices, and said the items selected by a customer could be brought from a nearby warehouse in “five minutes”. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
