   "title": "Korea's top diplomat discusses ties with German, Polish counterparts",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261101/koreas-top-diplomat-discusses-ties-with-german-polish-counterparts",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Sun, 01 Nov 2026 05:37:03 GMT",
   "_dt": 1793511423.0,
   "ageDays": 1.41,
   "summary": "Foreign Minister Cho Hyun met separately with his German and Polish counterparts on the sidelines of a Group of 20 (G20) meeting in Atlanta to discuss ways to enhance bilateral cooperation, his office said Saturday. Cho met with German Foreign Minister Johann Wadephul on Friday (U.S. time), expressing hope for deeper ties with the European nation in a wide range of areas, including defense, the economy and cutting-edge industries, according to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国外交部长赵显（Cho Hyun）在亚特兰大举行的二十国集团（G20）会议期间，分别会见德国和波兰外长，讨论加强双边合作的方法。外交部周六表示，赵显周五（美国时间）会见德国外长约翰·瓦德富尔（Johann Wadephul），并表示希望与这个欧洲国家在国防、经济和前沿产业等广泛领域建立更紧密的关系。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Foreign Minister Cho Hyun met separately with his German and Polish counterparts on the sidelines of a Group of 20 (G20) meeting in Atlanta to discuss ways to enhance bilateral cooperation, his office said Saturday. Cho met with German Foreign Minister Johann Wadephul on Friday (U.S. time), expressing hope for deeper ties with the European nation in a wide range of areas, including defense, the economy and cutting-edge industries, according to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. In response, Wadephul thanked Seoul's foreign ministry for successfully preparing for German Chancellor Friedrich Merz's recent visit to Korea and expressed hope for expanded cooperation in bilateral trade and investment. Cho also met with his Polish counterpart, Radoslaw Sikorski, and called for continued discussions on cooperation in areas such as defense and batteries as a follow-up to Polish Prime Minister Donald Tusk's visit to Korea in April, the ministry said. Sikorski also requested Korea's attention and support for Warsaw's efforts to join the G20, with Cho proposing continued consultations on the matter",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
