   "title": "US Court denies discovery request against Tinubu",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/us-court-denies-discovery-request-against-tinubu-dci-group-in-foia-litigation/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
   "source": "vanguardngr.com",
   "published": "Sun, 01 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793498400.0,
   "ageDays": 1.56,
   "summary": "ABUJA –The United States District Court for the District of Columbia has denied a motion by Aaron Greenspan seeking limited discovery from Nigerian President Bola Tinubu and DCI Group in ongoing litigation under the Freedom of Information Act (FOIA). “The Court’s decision makes clear that this Freedom of Information Act proceeding cannot be used to pursue discovery unrelated to the legal questions before it,” said attorney Christopher W.",
   "summary_zh": "阿布賈——美國哥倫比亞特區地方法院�回了亞倫·格林斯潘提出的一項動議。該動議要求在根據《信息自由法》（FOIA）進行的訴訟中，針對尼日利亞總統博拉·蒂努布和DCI Group進行有限證據開示。律師克里斯托弗·W.表示：「法院的裁定清楚表明，這宗《信息自由法》程序不能用於尋求與法院目前審理的法律問題無關的證據開示。」",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "ABUJA –The United States District Court for the District of Columbia has denied a motion by Aaron Greenspan seeking limited discovery from Nigerian President Bola Tinubu and DCI Group in ongoing litigation under the Freedom of Information Act (FOIA). “The Court’s decision makes clear that this Freedom of Information Act proceeding cannot be used to pursue discovery unrelated to the legal questions before it,” said attorney Christopher W. Carmichael. According to him, the Court also denied a separate motion by nonparty Karl Von Batten seeking permission to file an amicus curiae (friend-of-the-court) brief, as well as Greenspan’s related request for judicial notice. Additionally, the Court denied Greenspan’s motion for summary judgment. “The Court also denied the plaintiff’s motion for summary judgment and rejected a separate request to introduce an amicus brief,” said Attorney Oluwole Afolabi. Comments expressed here do not reflect the opinions of Vanguard newspapers or any employee thereof",
