   "_dt": 1793468854.0,
   "ageDays": 1.9,
   "summary": "Considering the export potential, especially of the MSMEs in the Union Territory, Federation of Indian Export Organisations, set up by the Union Ministry of Commerce, has been organising programmes to help MSMEs identify new overseas buyers, explore additional markets",
   "summary_zh": "鉴于联邦管辖区中小微企业（MSMEs）的出口潜力，由联邦商务部设立的印度出口商联合会一直在组织各项计划，帮助中小微企业寻找新的海外买家并开拓更多市场",
