   "snippet": "One by one all Nigerians will see the light. \nUSA doesn’t care about Nigeria or Nigerians. \nThey never have and never will. \nEven the cooperation he commended the Nigerian government for has to do with the mineral deal USA signed this year not with seriousness in tackling any insecurity. \nGo and read the terms of the minerals deal worth $700b you will understand the game USA is playing. They used the Christian’s massacre(an insecurity the USA is indirectly sponsoring) story to cajole our govt into signing it, this doesn’t mean that if we have a serious govt we can’t defeat insecurity. We can. \nNigerians We are the only ones who can save ourselves. And it can only be done through a revolution.",
