   "snippet": "CHINA WANTS PIECE — NOT PEACE.\n\nA piece of land. A piece of sea. A piece of territory.\n\nAcross the West Philippine Sea, China’s expansive maritime claims and coercive actions raise serious questions about respect for Philippine sovereignty and international law.\n\nThe issue is bigger than disputed waters. It concerns maritime rights, regional stability, and the principle that a nation’s territory and lawful entitlements cannot simply be claimed through pressure or force.\n\nThe Philippines must continue to stand firm through documented evidence, diplomacy, and the rule of international law.\nPeace requires respect—not the endless pursuit of someone else’s territory.\n\n#BRPSierraMadre #WPS #WestPhilippineSea #PhilippineSovereignty #MaritimeSecurity #UNCLOS #StandWithThePhilippines #RuleOfLaw #NotOneMore",
